#: kcmaccess.cpp:189
msgid "Audible Bell"
msgstr "Zingila Bideng"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:197
msgid "Use &system bell"
msgstr "Zingila &pergalê bi kar bîne"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:199
msgid "Us&e customized bell"
msgstr "Zingila takekesî bi &kar bîne"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:201
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, the default system bell will be used. See the "
"\"System Bell\" control module for how to customize the system bell. "
"Normally, this is just a \"beep\"."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:204
msgid ""
"<p>Check this option if you want to use a customized bell, playing a sound "
"file. If you do this, you will probably want to turn off the system bell.</"
"p><p> Please note that on slow machines this may cause a \"lag\" between the "
"event causing the bell and the sound being played.</p>"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:212
msgid "Sound &to play:"
msgstr "Dengê &lêxistinê:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:216
msgid "Browse..."
msgstr "Binihêre..."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:218
msgid ""
"If the option \"Use customized bell\" is enabled, you can choose a sound "
"file here. Click \"Browse...\" to choose a sound file using the file dialog."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:235
msgid "Visible Bell"
msgstr "Zingilê Xuya"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:243
msgid "&Use visible bell"
msgstr "Zingilê xuya &bi kar bîne"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:245
msgid ""
"This option will turn on the \"visible bell\", i.e. a visible notification "
"shown every time that normally just a bell would occur. This is especially "
"useful for deaf people."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:252
msgid "I&nvert screen"
msgstr "Dîmendêrê vajî bike"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:256
msgid ""
"All screen colors will be inverted for the amount of time specified below."
msgstr ""
"Hemû rengên dîmendêrê dê li gorî dema li jêr hatiye diyarkirin bên vajîkirin."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:258
msgid "F&lash screen"
msgstr "Ekrana f&laş"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:260
msgid ""
"The screen will turn to a custom color for the amount of time specified "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Di dema li jêr hatiye diyarkirin de dîmendêr dê veguheze rengekî takekesî"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:266
msgid ""
"Click here to choose the color used for the \"flash screen\" visible bell."
msgstr "Ji bo hilbijartina rengê \"flash screen\"n virê bitikîne"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:276
msgid "Duration:"
msgstr "Demajo"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:277 kcmaccess.cpp:391 kcmaccess.cpp:431
msgid " msec"
msgstr "mçir"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:279
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the duration of the \"visible bell\" effect being "
"shown."
msgstr ""
"Li virê dikarî demajoya ji bo xuyakirina efekta \"zingila cuya\" diyar bikî."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:296
